  "description": "Day 422 Of The Bull Market",
  "body_html": "<p>Good morning and Happy Wednesday. The S&amp;P 500 continues to push higher, a welcome rally after months of waiting! Trend is friend, we go with it. If you are looking for some stocks to pick up, check out my post yesterday, all 3 remain in buying range. Please note, I will <strong>NOT </strong>be picking up GSAT, the 4th stock I was watching, regardless of its earnings. It was one I was watching but have removed from the watchlist due to acquisition peg prices. </p><div class=\"digest-post-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;nodeId&quot;:&quot;363d4c45-51f7-439a-97a7-ab3784532f08&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;It’s been a brutal few months in the market. Day traders getting flung around. Iran War…Strait Of Hormuz…Tariffs…Yen Carry Trade… Foreign Market Collapses…so much negative news. And through all of that, I have maintained that we remain in a bull market, but to wait for breakouts to occur.&quot;,&quot;cta&quot;:null,&quot;showBylines&quot;:true,&quot;showDescription&quot;:true,&quot;showImage&quot;:true,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;lg&quot;,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Finally...I'm Buying Again&quot;,&quot;publishedBylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:301052325,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Investing • Market Analyst • 576,000 on TikTok • USNA • Featured on Business Insider &amp; Yahoo Finance • NO POLITICS&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:100}],&quot;post_date&quot;:&quot;2026-08-04T13:31:19.773Z&quot;,&quot;cover_image&quot;:&quot;https://substack-video.s3.amazonaws.com/video_upload/post/209780507/fc2cb545-b118-4450-af40-1b2e27e25b85/transcoded-1785848998.png&quot;,&quot;cover_image_alt&quot;:null,&quot;canonical_url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/finallyim-buying-again&quot;,&quot;section_name&quot;:null,&quot;video_upload_id&quot;:&quot;fc2cb545-b118-4450-af40-1b2e27e25b85&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:209780507,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;podcast&quot;,&quot;reaction_count&quot;:67,&quot;comment_count&quot;:5,&quot;publication_id&quot;:3537822,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLq1!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F96c222d2-04e7-4e47-9e11-4b10f4cee9c4_854x854.png&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;youtube_url&quot;:null,&quot;show_links&quot;:null,&quot;feed_url&quot;:null}\"></div><p>The video here discusses why I bash some stocks, the most common reason being new investors circle jerking a company. There is too much euphoria, a major signal a stock is at a top, at least locally if not on a macro level. Its a perk of having so many followers, I can see what the sentiment is of the masses. Its also why I am hated sometimes lol. </p><p>Also discuss that, even though I do short, it is not the bulk of my strategy. Michael Burry, the #2 finance author here on Substack, <strong>LOVES</strong> to lose money. He has lost -83% of his portfolio value over the years. Why he has such a following, besides being a movie star, I’ll never understand. The last short I did was Netflix, in October 2025. Full disclosure, I only caught a piece of the move downwards, as I went on vacation, and as mentioned in the video, short positions require daily management. It is far easier, as both an investor, and a face in the finance niche, to find great stocks going upwards. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2zK8!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4eefa310-718a-4947-9b7e-8a044459a250_1312x832.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2zK8!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4eefa310-718a-4947-9b7e-8a044459a250_1312x832.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2zK8!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4eefa310-718a-4947-9b7e-8a044459a250_1312x832.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2zK8!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4eefa310-718a-4947-9b7e-8a044459a250_1312x832.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2zK8!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4eefa310-718a-4947-9b7e-8a044459a250_1312x832.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2zK8!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4eefa310-718a-4947-9b7e-8a044459a250_1312x832.png\" width=\"1312\" height=\"832\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4eefa310-718a-4947-9b7e-8a044459a250_1312x832.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:832,&quot;width&quot;:1312,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:225340,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/209923599?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4eefa310-718a-4947-9b7e-8a044459a250_1312x832.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2zK8!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4eefa310-718a-4947-9b7e-8a044459a250_1312x832.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2zK8!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4eefa310-718a-4947-9b7e-8a044459a250_1312x832.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2zK8!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4eefa310-718a-4947-9b7e-8a044459a250_1312x832.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!2zK8!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4eefa310-718a-4947-9b7e-8a044459a250_1312x832.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h4>Just because I “bash” a stock, does not mean I want to short it. We have to be in a bear market first of all. I may bash a stock if I see low profit potential and/or the odds are against you!</h4><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>I expect today to be somewhat of a quiet day. After picking up the new positions, I usually pause briefly, check that the strategy is working. Scale in more if yes, pause or scale out if no. </p><p>We have a few new faces here. If you are struggling to find your way around Substack, check out the<strong> <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-playbook-everything?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Playbook</a>,</strong> that tells you where everything is at, what it is and is linked to take you there. </p><p>You are also welcome to tag me in the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/f0cce345-4d01-43b4-87c8-60102042ebb8\">Main Chat</a> if you have any questions. I read ALL notifications here on Substack. Don’t be shy. </p><p>Lastly, expect Mid-Week Movers this week. I will use the list from last week. So be on the lookout for that tomorrow. </p><h4>Don’t forget to LIKE ❤️ and re-stack please, its how we combat AI slop and fake gurus here! </h4><p>Thanks for stopping by! </p><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/we-are-in-bull-market-stop-shorting?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Thanks for reading Timothy’s StockTok! This post is public so feel free to share it.</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/we-are-in-bull-market-stop-shorting?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/we-are-in-bull-market-stop-shorting?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div>",
